# Fabrication Foundry: "{T}: Add {W}. Spend this mana only to cast an artifact spell or activate an ability of an artifact source." and
# "{2}{W}, {T}, Exile ...: Return ... Activate only as a sorcery." (CR 106.6, 602.5d).
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Foundry (Mox Pearl's {W}, Mox Jet's {B}) and taps it for {W}: the Shatter (no artifact spell) cannot be paid with it though a
# Mox Ruby stands untapped, the Sol Ring (an artifact spell) can; the Sol Ring's {C}{C} pay a Mind Stone. Turn 2 Bot2 destroys the Mox Pearl. On turn 3
# Bot1 has {C}{C} (the Sol Ring) in the pool and no {W} (a Plains is still in hand): the ability is refused; with the Plains played and tapped, {2}{W} is
# paid exactly, X = 2 on the Mind Stone, and the Pearl (mana value 0 or less than 2) returns. Exiling the Mind Stone leaves the Sol Ring.

